  "selected_clauses": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.52,
      "end": 6.08,
      "text": "做丝绒这个品类里,我觉得我们做的是非常非常细的。",
      "members": [
        1
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 6.52,
      "end": 8.48,
      "text": "因为我们的丝绒原料全不是做定制的。",
      "members": [
        2
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.72,
      "end": 10.7,
      "text": "以至于这么多年喜欢穿丝绒这个品类的女生,",
      "members": [
        3
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 10.88,
      "end": 13.5,
      "text": "很多很多姐妹,只要买丝绒都会想到来泽泽家。",
      "members": [
        4
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.64,
      "end": 15.26,
      "text": "只要你泽泽做,我不会去其他家买。",
      "members": [
        5
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 21.34,
      "end": 25.18,
      "text": "我今年这个丝绒的累积销量已经在五万米都得有了。",
      "members": [
        9
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 70.83,
      "end": 72.55,
      "text": "而且这是松紧药的侧面有拉链",
      "members": [
        33
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 72.55,
      "end": 73.97,
      "text": "卡马全都给我玩小牌就行了",
      "members": [
        34
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 73.97,
      "end": 76.35,
      "text": "我觉得咱家这个裙子啊最大马都能穿到150",
      "members": [
        35,
        36
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 76.65,
      "end": 77.95,
      "text": "而且我给大家准备了长短款",
      "members": [
        37
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 131.5,
      "end": 134.0,
      "text": "裙子的话不导毛不导毛不泛白",
      "members": [
        62
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 134.0,
      "end": 135.88,
      "text": "随便穿洗随便丢击洗",
      "members": [
        63
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 141.86,
      "end": 147.56,
      "text": "克重还是比较高的姐妹们比咱们夏天的那个叫丝绒情书要厚",
      "members": [
        67,
        68
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 153.34,
      "end": 155.68,
      "text": "1米6的话可以穿长的1米59以下穿短的",
      "members": [
        73
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 203.58,
      "end": 206.26,
      "text": "所有人都在穿因为它好洗穿起来还耐脏",
      "members": [
        88
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 226.1,
      "end": 229.04,
      "text": "我都穿两年了是吧我觉得是就这种东西你就穿去吧",
      "members": [
        94
      ],
      "group": 11,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "start": 293.56,
      "end": 295.2,
      "text": "你去搭这种小大衣的时候它也很好看",
      "members": [
        133
      ],
      "group": 12,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "start": 300.4,
      "end": 303.38,
      "text": "这条丝终群85跟75两个长度",
      "members": [
        137
      ],
      "group": 13,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "start": 303.38,
      "end": 304.96,
      "text": "而且丝终的弹力非常的大",
      "members": [
        138
      ],
      "group": 14,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 305.94,
      "end": 309.16,
      "text": "这种丝终都是我们开年定制上万米每一年都要卖",
      "members": [
        140,
        141
      ],
      "group": 15,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "start": 309.16,
      "end": 312.56,
      "text": "今年我估计总销量都要突破可能六七万米左右吧",
      "members": [
        142,
        143
      ],
      "group": 16,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 322.16,
      "end": 323.96,
      "text": "这个跟你们外面买到的丝是不一样的",
      "members": [
        151
      ],
      "group": 17,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "start": 323.96,
      "end": 325.76,
      "text": "上手的手感是非常滑的而且不爱粘毛",
      "members": [
        152
      ],
      "group": 18,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 153,
      "start": 325.76,
      "end": 329.04,
      "text": "这条裙子的版型就是那种鱼尾风格的非常女人的不爱粘",
      "members": [
        153
      ],
      "group": 19,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 157,
      "start": 333.62,
      "end": 338.72,
      "text": "只是说想让更多女人风格的女生能穿出这种很有母妹的感觉所以我们才做了这个鱼尾",
      "members": [
        157,
        158,
        159
      ],
      "group": 20,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 160,
      "start": 338.72,
      "end": 340.5,
      "text": "我们家丝绒的版型裙形特别多",
      "members": [
        160
      ],
      "group": 21,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "start": 359.9,
      "end": 362.02,
      "text": "真的是很多人都一直在创我们家的私容",
      "members": [
        175
      ],
      "group": 22,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 317.2,
      "end": 322.16,
      "text": "这种能做定制定单的丝终一定是你今年买到的最好的制好的一定要去试一下你才知道",
      "members": [
